    "title_en": "Helicity Constraints To Soft Factor Of All Spin",
    "abstract_en": "In this note we derive a set of non-perturbative constraints for soft operators from the Wigner's little group scaling of scattering amplitudes in a soft limit. We also show that the resolution of such constraints generates a master formula for the analytic expression of the single soft factor of any given spin and helicity.",
